@startuml Test Architecture and Coverage
!theme plain
title <font size=20><b>Test Architecture: Unit Tests for Payment Component</b></font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam package {
    BorderColor #000000
    BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam component {
    BorderColor #000000
    BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFACD
    BorderColor #000000
    FontColor #000000
}

package "tests/Unit" #F5F5F5 {

    package "Component/Contract" #BBDEFB {
        component "PaymentContractTest" as PCT #90CAF9
        component "ContractConditionTest" as CCT #90CAF9
        component "ContractStateTest" as CST #90CAF9
        component "BasketSnapshotTest" as BST #90CAF9
    }

    package "Component/Repository" #FFF9C4 {
        component "MetadataPersistenceTest" as MPT #FFE082
        component "DoctrineContractRepositoryTest" as DCRT #FFE082
    }

    package "Component/EventSystem" #E1BEE7 {
        component "EventDispatcherTest" as EDT #CE93D8
        component "EventListenerProviderTest" as ELPT #CE93D8
        component "EventContextTest" as ECT #CE93D8
    }

    package "Stripe/EventSystem/Handler" #FFE0B2 {
        component "StripeContractCreationHandlerTest" as SCCHT #FFCC80
        component "StripeCheckoutSessionHandlerTest" as SCSHT #FFCC80
        component "StripeCheckoutReturnHandlerTest" as SCRHT #FFCC80
        component "PaymentAuthorizedEventHandlerTest" as PAEHT #FFCC80
        component "StripeOrderCreationHandlerTest" as SOCT #FFCC80
    }

    package "Stripe/Model" #FFCDD2 {
        component "OrderAddressValidationTest" as OAVT #EF9A9A
        component "OrderTest" as OT #EF9A9A
    }

    package "Stripe/Controller" #C8E6C9 {
        component "StripeOrderControllerTest" as SOCT2 #A5D6A7
    }
}

note right of PCT
    **Tests:**
    - testCreateContract
    - testFulfillCondition
    - testTransitionToPending
    - testTransitionToReadyWhenAllFulfilled
    - testCommitToOrder
    - testMetadataStorage
end note

note right of MPT #C8E6C9
    **CRITICAL TESTS (Bug Fix):**
    - testMetadataIsIncludedInPreparedData
    - testMetadataIsRestoredFromDatabase
    - testEmptyMetadataIsHandledCorrectly
    - testNullMetadataIsHandledCorrectly
end note

note right of OAVT #C8E6C9
    **CRITICAL TESTS (Bug Fix):**
    - testValidateDeliveryAddressUsesSessionHashForStripePayments
    - testExpectedBehaviorForStripeFix

    **Documents the fix:**
    - Request param empty (GET redirect)
    - Session has hash (restored from contract)
    - Stripe Order model reads from session
end note

note as Legend
    **Test Categories:**

    | Category | Purpose | Count |
    |----------|---------|-------|
    | Contract Domain | PaymentContract, Conditions, State | ~20 |
    | Repository | Persistence, Hydration | ~10 |
    | Event System | Dispatcher, Provider, Context | ~15 |
    | Handlers | Event handling logic | ~25 |
    | Model | OXID model extensions | ~10 |
    | Controller | HTTP request handling | ~10 |

    **Total: ~90 unit tests**

    **Bug Fix Tests (Highlighted in green):**
    - MetadataPersistenceTest: 4 tests
    - OrderAddressValidationTest: 2 tests
end note

legend right
    |= Color |= Category |
    | <#BBDEFB> | Contract Domain |
    | <#FFF9C4> | Repository |
    | <#E1BEE7> | Event System |
    | <#FFE0B2> | Handlers |
    | <#FFCDD2> | Model |
    | <#C8E6C9> | Controller |
endlegend

@enduml

